{"title":"“十五五”时期，国家水网建设将做好五方面工作！","date":"2026-04-14","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span class=\"js_title_inner\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px;\">&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;时期，国家水网建设将做好五方面工作！</span></h1>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin:0px 0px 20px;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row;margin:0px 0px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:100%;vertical-align:top;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;background-color:rgba(189, 216, 245, 0.2);overflow:hidden;padding:0px 27px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:17px;color:rgb(34, 31, 31);letter-spacing:0px;line-height:2;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;规划纲要明确提出&ldquo;加快建设现代化水网&rdquo;。水利部副部长孙志禹在水利部近日举办的新闻发布会上介绍，聚焦国家水网建设，&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;时期水利部门将着力做好五方面工作。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0px 30px;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"95%\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block;line-height:0;width:95%;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:2;padding:0px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color:#0d5db7;box-sizing:border-box;\">一是完善水资源配置和供水保障体系。</span></strong>包括推进南水北调后续工程高质量建设，基本建成现代化水库运行管理矩阵，建成一批安全大坝、生态大坝、智能大坝，整装推进一批大中型灌区现代化改造等。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(13, 93, 183); box-sizing: border-box;\">二是加快构建现代化流域防洪减灾体系。</span></strong>加快转变洪水传统治理管理理念和模式，统筹洪水控制、洪水利用、洪水塑造，完善适应气候变化的现代化水旱灾害防御体系。具体包括推动黄河古贤水利枢纽工程全面实施；研究论证推进拒马河张坊、永定河官厅山峡洪水控制工程等。加紧补齐北方地区防洪排涝抗灾基础设施短板。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(13, 93, 183); box-sizing: border-box;\">三是完善河湖生态系统保护治理体系。</span></strong>我国将全面建设安澜江河、生命江河、幸福江河；启动新一轮母亲河复苏行动，持续推进京杭大运河、永定河、西辽河全线水流贯通，保障重点河湖生态安全。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(13, 93, 183); box-sizing: border-box;\">四是加快数字孪生水网建设。</span></strong>坚持&ldquo;需求牵引、应用至上，数智赋能、提升能力&rdquo;，加快构建数字孪生水网，分类推进水利工程数智化改造，完善&ldquo;天空地水工&rdquo;一体化监测感知系统、&ldquo;高保真&rdquo;数字流场模拟数学模型系统，全面提升水网建设运行数字化、网络化、智能化水平。</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(13, 93, 183); box-sizing: border-box;\">五是持续完善水网建设运营机制。</span></strong>持续深化水利投融资改革。积极探索和规范推进用水权交易。综合施策加力推动水价改革，健全水价动态调整机制。健全重大水利工程建设运行管理机制，提高工程运营可持续性。</span></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"transform-origin:center center;-webkit-transform-origin:center center;-moz-transform-origin:center center;-o-transform-origin:center center;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:scale(0.97);-webkit-transform:scale(0.97);-moz-transform:scale(0.97);-ms-transform:scale(0.97);-o-transform:scale(0.97);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:4px 0% 8px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgba(209, 225, 237, 0.757);height:2px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:0px 0px 30px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-ms-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:left;color:rgba(62, 62, 62, 0.79);line-height:2;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>"}